{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104286","id":2398936373,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6O_N01","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104286","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104286.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104286.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104286","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104286/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104286/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104286/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/fde71e0382970dbac449603ebec9433f57aee3a4","number":104286,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Harmonize `String`, `Vector` and `LocalVector` `find` and `rfind`.","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This should result in fewer surprises when dealing with `find` and `rfind` functions across Godot, helping to address https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/5144.\r\n\r\nThe changes to individual functions are: \r\n- `LocalVector::find` accepts negative `p_from`, either to index from the back or return `-1`.\r\n- `rfind` returns `-1` instead of searching the whole sequence for invalid `p_from` arguments.\r\n- `find` accepts negative `p_from` arguments that are within bounds, indicating an index from the back. Inserting any negative value used to always return `-1`.\r\n\r\nThis is somewhat of a breaking change across public APIs (`GDScript` affected).\r\nHowever, all changes deal with 'unordinary' / invalid values (negative and `> size()`. I think the change is an acceptable price to pay to harmonize the functions. But let's discuss!\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","number":22,"state":"closed","title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/f